f06969f0-b481-42eb-a027-c5e8269555c4	NUDIFLORUM	Nasomatto	\N	Part of the Nasomatto collection Nudiflorum is a pure, nude desire in the translucence of our senses. The fragrance provides the extreme and unexpected tranquility of giving oneself to the other without any concern or boundary, created upon the feeling of pure intimacy. This fragrance is an invitation to sense the depth that undoes the distance, motivated by a hazy intuition to reveal the unarguable and inescapable truth.	{Rhubarb}	{Raspberry,rose,salicylate}	{Animalic,cedar,leather,"oak moss The cap of the bottle is made of padauk wood","also known as Vermillion","an exotic rigid and stable African coralwood found in the central and tropical West Africa.","Oak Moss"}	{}	\N	https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0733/6935/4506/files/Nudiflorum-ProductPage3-30ML.jpg	2026-05-16 16:12:42.112757+00	[{"size": "30ml", "currency": "USD", "price_max": 195, "price_min": 195}]	other
3ab843d9-af2a-4aba-83bb-5dbae135e161	ABSINTH	Nasomatto	\N	Part of the Nasomatto collection Absinth aims to evoke degrees of hysteria and irresponsible behavior. A dedication to controversial absinth, forbidden because of a component called thujone, a ketone that contains THC. It has an aromatic green odor and known to stimulate serotonin. Absinth is a perfume inspired by escapism towards happiness and careless snickering laughs, a moment of delirium that makes one forget about the troubles and dive into a luxurious type of madness.	{Citrus,"green notes",pepper,spice,wormwood}	{Veitver,Vetiver}	{Gourmand,musk,"patchouli The cap of the bottle is made of a very thick olive wood. Finding the suitable timber with a proper thickness for producing these caps was a time consuming research on its own",patchouli}	{}	\N	https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0733/6935/4506/files/Absinth-ProductPage3-30ML.jpg	2026-05-16 16:12:42.112757+00	[{"size": "30ml", "currency": "USD", "price_max": 195, "price_min": 195}]	other
