21dc44a6-bfd4-43b7-b3f2-e4139e94d040	Escentric 05	Escentric Molecules	\N	Immerse yourself in the cerulean blue of Escentric 05, a portal to the summerscapes of the Mediterranean. “Cashmeran is dry, radiant, warm and woody with an unexpected touch of pine resin,” says Perfumer Geza Schoen. “That gave me the idea of creating a different kind of summer fragrance. I wanted to evoke what it was like to be by the sea, but not by using the usual marine	{Fig,Bergamot,Orange,Laurel,Rosemary,Basil,Juniper}	{"Hedione (Green Jasmine Bud)",Cypress,"Deconstructed Florals: Freesia",Iris,Jasmine}	{Cashmeran,Cistus,Labdanum,Musc,AMBROXAN™,Mastic,"Iso E Super",cypress,"cistus labdanum"}	{}	\N	https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0259/2797/4970/files/ESCENTRICMOLECULES_ESCENTRIC_05.jpg?v=1713201239	2026-05-16 21:48:16.780307+00	[{"size": "100ml", "currency": "USD", "price_max": 175, "price_min": 175}]	other
3bd5f108-5662-4a55-9271-903ce41f47b0	Escentric 04	Escentric Molecules	\N	Enter the synaesthetic palette of Escentric 04, robed in diluted magenta and flushed with salacious grapefruit. Javanol is a sandalwood-type molecule that retains the radiance and endurance of natural sandalwood but is sheer and transparent like no sandalwood in nature. Escentric 04 focuses on Javanol in a formula that highlights the grapefruit accent in the molecule. The result is a uniquely fresh interpretation of a sandalwood fragrance, fizzing with crisp, bitter top	{"Methyl Pamplemousse","Pink Grapefruit",Marijuana,Bergamot,"Juniper Berry","Pink Pepper",grapefruit,lime,juniper}	{"Hedione (green jasmine bud)",Freesia,Osmanthus,Orris,Rose}	{Javanol,Mastic,Labdanum,"Iso E Super","Muscone (Musk)",AMBROXAN™,sandalwood,polysantol}	{}	\N	https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0259/2797/4970/files/ESCENTRIC_MOLECULES_ESCENTRIC_04.jpg?v=1713201145	2026-05-16 21:48:18.219916+00	[{"size": "100ml", "currency": "USD", "price_max": 175, "price_min": 175}]	other
57d234a3-e3ca-4fa1-9520-4827ae79195b	Escentric 03	Escentric Molecules	\N	Let the soothing sap green of Escentric 03 conjure up odour images and pull you into a lush fantasy of multisensorial overload. Vetiveryl Acetate could be described as a hybrid molecule, half-natural, half-synthetic. It is a fraction of vetiver oil distilled from the roots of an Indian grass, which is then ‘crossed’ with acetic acid to remove the bitter and leathery aspects of the root. Escentric 03 focuses on Vetiveryl Acetate in a formula that pays tribute to the three roots used in perfumery:	{"Green Notes",Lime,Mandarine,"Pink Pepper","Black Pepper",Ginger}	{Freesia,Rose,"Hedione (green jasmine bud)",Jasmin,Orris,Cinnamon,Tonka,Jasmine,Tea,Hedione}	{Vetiver,Sandalwood,"Iso E Super",Leather,"Muscone (Musk)",Amber,Costus,Cedar,Balsams,Musk}	{}	\N	https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0259/2797/4970/files/ESCENTRIC_MOLECULES_ESCENTRIC_03.jpg?v=1713200990	2026-05-16 21:48:20.669343+00	[{"size": "100ml", "currency": "USD", "price_max": 175, "price_min": 175}]	other
ea4e448f-edb7-4bb1-a122-f11f129e9003	Escentric 02	Escentric Molecules	\N	Shift the spectrum of your reality with the basking golden tangerine of Escentric 02. Ambroxan has a subtle sensual quality with a radiant, long-lasting drydown. Escentric 02 contains 13.5% Ambroxan* in a formula designed to amplify its mineral note with hedione (green jasmine bud), a 'gin and tonic' accord, "and a hint of the Austrian lemonade called almdudler." Schoen describes the final effect as "super-longlasting freshness into the drydown, with a subtle sensuality." *13.5% is the maximum p	{Almdudler,"Juniper Berry",Mandarine,Lime,Bergamot}	{Ginger,Freesia,"Clary Sage","Pink Pepper","Hedione (green jasmine bud)",Orris,Hedione}	{"Muscone (Musk)",AMBROXAN™,Vetiver,Tonka,Muscone,Ambroxan}	{}	\N	https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0259/2797/4970/files/ESCENTRICMOLECULES_ESCENTRIC_02.jpg?v=1713200871	2026-05-16 21:48:22.722863+00	[{"size": "100ml", "currency": "USD", "price_max": 175, "price_min": 175}]	other
90fb6d97-cf6f-4c91-80f5-0c3f06485882	Amber Room	Thameen	\N	Part of The Treasure Collection Glowing at the heart of the Catherine Palace near St Petersburg, the original Amber room was lined entirely with amber panels and backed with gold leaf and mirrors. When lit with more than five hundred candles it was reputed to glow like trapped sunshine. Famed as the Eighth Wonder of the World, this glowing room filled with amber is the inspiration behind this beautiful warm fragrance.	{Bergamot,"Floridian grapefruit",ginger,"Indian cardamom","Baie rose"}	{"Bulgarian rose",patchouli,cinnamon}	{Amber,sandalwood,olibanum,vetivert,"tonka absolute"}	{}	\N	https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0259/2797/4970/products/Thameen_0000s_0010_amber_room_50ml.png?v=1658238208	2026-05-16 21:52:50.319447+00	[{"size": "50ml", "currency": "USD", "price_max": 220, "price_min": 220}]	other
